-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §147: an intern whose internship is the year
-- after finishing the degree and the certificate (and a graduate of the
-- three-year excellence programme) is paid as a beginning B.A. teacher, by
-- the position held, to the end of March; then as §146(3).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
IMPORT `base-agreement-146`
§ `147`

-- akn:art_147 The section's heading line: the pay of an intern whose internship year follows the studies, and in the year after it.

-- (א): a B.A. teacher's pay, grade 1, seniority 0, by the position held, to
-- the end of March. (ב): shown the entitlement by then, he is on the B.A.
-- table for the rest of the year; (ג): not entitled by then, "דרגת שכר של
-- מתמחה, כאמור בסעיף 147(א) (1)" from the start of the year, the
-- difference deducted; (ד): entitled and not shown, as (ג) until shown.
-- F-ofek-hadash-base-147-a: §147(א) has no paragraph (1); the intern's
-- grade is §146(1)'s, which the reading adopted takes (convention
-- reading.misprint).
@ref akn:art_147__para_a akn:art_147__para_b akn:art_147__para_c akn:art_147__para_d
GIVEN `entitled to the degree and certificate by the end of March` IS A BOOLEAN
      `showed it by the end of March` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `intern's pay`
DECIDE `pay in an internship after the studies` `entitled to the degree and certificate by the end of March` `showed it by the end of March` IS
    `pay in the year after the internship` `entitled to the degree and certificate by the end of March` `showed it by the end of March`

-- The numbered paragraphs the text gives 147(א): none; it is one sentence.
`the numbered paragraphs of 147(א)` MEANS filter (GIVEN n YIELD FALSE) (LIST 1)
`the paragraph 147(ג) cites` MEANS 1
`147(ג) cites a paragraph (1) that 147(א) does not have` MEANS
    NOT elem `the paragraph 147(ג) cites` `the numbered paragraphs of 147(א)`
#ASSERT `147(ג) cites a paragraph (1) that 147(א) does not have`

-- (ה)–(ו): the notice by 1 September and the two-year limit, as §146(3).
@ref akn:art_147__para_e akn:art_147__para_f
GIVEN `years since the internship began` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may still be paid as an intern after the studies` `years since the internship began` IF
    `may still be paid as an intern` `years since the internship began`

-- (ז): the section applies too, with the changes needed (seniority among
-- them), to one whose degree is earlier and who finished the teaching
-- certificate and is interning.
@ref akn:art_147__para_g
GIVEN `holds an earlier degree` IS A BOOLEAN, `finished the teaching certificate and interning` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 147 applies to an earlier graduate` `holds an earlier degree` `finished the teaching certificate and interning` IF
    `holds an earlier degree` AND `finished the teaching certificate and interning`

#ASSERT `pay in an internship after the studies` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `a B.A. teacher's pay, grade 1, seniority 0`
